Only custom hearbeat. One is ping based, you can spy it with
packetfilters and tcpdump on active cluster network. The other is
badly named SCSI ping, thru shared storage inteconnect to avoid
partitioning when a member is network isolated on all cluster
networks.

Daemons interactions and director election mechanism are very well
described in doc.

