> hardware addresses?  These intimate little details cannot be 
> invisible to an OS.

Actually, they can. The boot-loader can load appropriate modules for the
hardware that do that work for the OS. That's the intent of the IBM-PC BIOS,
for example (though the implementation left much to be desired).

